        ;=======================================;
        ; Error Messages                        ;
        ;=======================================;
#Enomem
`eError:`Z

 Cannot execute the command.
 Not enough conventional memory.

#Etbase
`eError:`Z

 Cannot load the EX2284ST.EXE cloning program.
 Copy the EX2284ST.EXE file from the original disk to the same
 directory as the EX2284.EXE file or to the working disk.

#Ecotf
`eError:`Z

 Cannot make a temporary file. Check the following:

 - Is the program disk write-protected ?
 - Is more than 20 k of disk space free ?
 - That the attribute of the EX2284.STT temporary file
   is not set as read-only.

#Enout105
`eError:`Z

 No UT-111 Unit. 

#Epwd
`eError:`Z
 
 Five Digit Access Code error. 
 
#Enoticom
`eError:`Z

 Unknown Unit. 

